{'symbol': 'ETR', 'date': '2021-11-16 14:55:00', 'title': 'ENTERGY CELEBRATES 20 YEARS OF RECOGNITION AS A LEADER IN SUSTAINABILITY', 'text': 'NEW ORLEANS, NOV. 16, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0ENTERGY CORPORATION, A NATIONAL LEADER IN SUSTAINABILITY AND ENVIRONMENTAL STEWARDSHIP, HAS EARNED A PLACE ON THE DOW JONES SUSTAINABILITY INDEX NORTH AMERICA FOR 20 STRAIGHT YEARS. THE DJSI IS ONE OF THE MOST PRESTIGIOUS ENVIRONMENTAL, SOCIAL AND GOVERNANCE RANKINGS FOR CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY AND SUSTAINABILITY PERFORMANCE.'}